  "mode": "logit_deviation",
  "status": "entity-embedding member, 12 epochs / embedding 32 / dropout 0.15, sixteen seeds averaged.  Schedule chosen on 2022 by blend gain (interior maximum); verified on 2024.  Alpha comes from the leaderboard: 0.05, 0.08 and 0.12 measured +19.378, +26.928 and +32.278, and a quadratic through them fits to +/-0.006 points with an optimum at 0.1395 for eight seeds.  Sixteen seeds lift the holdout peak from +14.026 to +15.266 and move the fitted optimum to 0.148; 0.14 sits 0.09 points below that peak and close to the optimum measured directly, so it leans on the extrapolation as little as possible.  Per-league weights: the member is worth much less on Futures rows -- best holdout weight 0.05 there against 0.11 on Regular, where a single weight optimises at 0.10.  Applying that ratio around the leaderboard-measured optimum of 0.145 gives R 0.16 and F 0.07, worth +0.973 on the holdout (+16.151 against +15.178).  Evidence: analysis/nn_member_tuning.md"
